# CODEOWNERS — Dshield
#
# This file drives GitHub's PR auto-reviewer assignment. Each rule below
# assigns ownership of the matching paths; PRs touching those paths will
# automatically request a review from the listed owners.
#
# Format: <pattern> <owner1> <owner2> ...
# Order matters: the LAST matching pattern wins. Put the most-specific
# rules first and the catch-all rule at the end.
#
# Owner syntax:
#   @username             GitHub user or org member handle
#   @org/team-name        GitHub team handle (requires admin/owner rights)
#
# See: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

# --------------------------------------------------
# Default owners (apply when no more-specific rule matches below)
# --------------------------------------------------
*       @Dshield-xyz/maintainers

# --------------------------------------------------
# circuits/ — Noir zero-knowledge proof code
# Owners must hold a Cryptography/Protocol Engineering mandate and have
# reviewed at least one ZK circuit PR in the past 90 days.
# --------------------------------------------------
/circuits/                       @Dshield-xyz/maintainers
/circuits/compliance/            @Dshield-xyz/maintainers
/circuits/disclosure/            @Dshield-xyz/maintainers
/circuits/hasher/                @Dshield-xyz/maintainers
/circuits/shielded_pool/         @Dshield-xyz/maintainers

# --------------------------------------------------
# contracts/ — Soroban smart contracts (Rust)
# Owners must hold a Smart Contract Engineering mandate and have completed
# at least one Soroban audit cycle. Only the named contract owner may
# approve changes to their respective area without a second maintainer.
# --------------------------------------------------
/contracts/                      @Dshield-xyz/maintainers
/contracts/compliance/           @Dshield-xyz/maintainers
/contracts/pool/                 @Dshield-xyz/maintainers
/contracts/verifier/             @Dshield-xyz/maintainers

# --------------------------------------------------
# frontend/ — Next.js UI code
# Owners must hold a Frontend Engineering mandate.
# --------------------------------------------------
/frontend/                       @Dshield-xyz/maintainers

# --------------------------------------------------
# Protocol-critical documentation
# --------------------------------------------------
/DESIGN.md                       @Dshield-xyz/maintainers
/README.md                       @Dshield-xyz/maintainers
/CONTRIBUTING.md                 @Dshield-xyz/maintainers
/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md              @Dshield-xyz/maintainers

# --------------------------------------------------
# CI / release tooling
# --------------------------------------------------
/.github/workflows/              @Dshield-xyz/maintainers
/.github/CODEOWNERS              @Dshield-xyz/maintainers
/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/         @Dshield-xyz/maintainers
/.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md @Dshield-xyz/maintainers
/justfile                        @Dshield-xyz/maintainers
